---
// src/pages/about.astro
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="About InfraHub — Infrastructure Sourcing & Advisory"
  description="Learn about InfraHub's commercial model, delivery roles, and mission to connect businesses with specialist infrastructure providers."
  canonicalPath="/about"
>
  <div class="about-page-wrapper">
    <div class="container about-container">
      
      <!-- Editorial Header -->
      <header class="about-header">
        <span class="about-kicker">COMPANY &amp; COMMERCIAL MODEL</span>
        <h1 class="about-title">Better infrastructure decisions begin with understanding the requirement.</h1>
        <p class="about-lead">
          InfraHub operates as an independent infrastructure sourcing and technical advisory desk. We help engineering and commercial teams evaluate technical constraints, compare architectural options, and connect directly with specialist providers across networking, compute, cloud, security, and hardware.
        </p>
      </header>

      <!-- Business Architecture Narrative -->
      <section class="about-narrative-section">
        <div class="narrative-grid">
          <div class="narrative-main">
            <h2 class="narrative-heading">How InfraHub Operates</h2>
            <p class="narrative-prose">
              The modern infrastructure market is fragmented. No single carrier, cloud hyperscaler, or hardware distributor leads across every metro, route, and workload.
            </p>
            <p class="narrative-prose">
              Rather than reselling commodity cloud or operating as a rigid reseller, InfraHub acts as an experienced sourcing guide. We clarify technical parameters—such as committed data rates, latency thresholds, physical conduit diversity, and hypervisor dependencies—before matching you with the specialist operator best equipped for that exact scope.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="commercial-disclosure-box">
            <h3 class="disclosure-title">Commercial Transparency</h3>
            <p class="disclosure-text">
              InfraHub is compensated by participating network carriers, hardware distributors, and platform operators when a qualified introduction results in an executed agreement.
            </p>
            <p class="disclosure-text">
              Sourcing through InfraHub never adds fees or intermediary markups to your provider invoices. You contract directly with the selected specialist under their standard master service terms.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Three Commercial Delivery Roles -->
      <section class="roles-section">
        <div class="roles-header">
          <h2 class="roles-title">Three Commercial Delivery Roles</h2>
          <p class="roles-subhead">
            Infrastructure requirements differ in delivery mechanics. We maintain strict clarity regarding InfraHub's role in every transaction.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="roles-flow">
          <div class="role-card">
            <div class="role-meta">
              <span class="role-index">01</span>
              <span class="role-type">Sourcing &amp; Procurement</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="role-title">Hardware Sourcing</h3>
            <p class="role-desc">
              Sourcing enterprise server hardware, optical transceivers, switches, and optics through verified distributors. Quotations, hardware warranties, and delivery logistics are coordinated directly with certified stocking partners.
            </p>
            <span class="role-scope">Servers / Switches / Optics / Memory Allocations</span>
          </div>

          <div class="role-card">
            <div class="role-meta">
              <span class="role-index">02</span>
              <span class="role-type">Direct Specialist Introduction</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="role-title">Partner-Delivered Services</h3>
            <p class="role-desc">
              InfraHub evaluates requirements and introduces your engineering team directly to specialized network carriers, scrubbing providers, and colocation operators. The partner contracts and operates the service under their own SLAs.
            </p>
            <span class="role-scope">IP Transit / Lit Waves / DDoS Scrubbing / Managed NOC</span>
          </div>

          <div class="role-card">
            <div class="role-meta">
              <span class="role-index">03</span>
              <span class="role-type">Architecture &amp; Benchmarking</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="role-title">Advisory &amp; Evaluation</h3>
            <p class="role-desc">
              Vendor-neutral technical guidance: multi-carrier BGP evaluations, physical conduit diversity reviews, VMware migration cost benchmarking, and commercial contract reviews to ensure technical and commercial alignment.
            </p>
            <span class="role-scope">Route Diversity / BGP Strategy / VMware Alternatives</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Closing Direct Action -->
      <section class="about-cta-band">
        <div class="cta-inner">
          <div class="cta-copy">
            <h2 class="cta-title">Discuss an upcoming infrastructure requirement.</h2>
            <p class="cta-desc">Whether you have a known specification or need assistance benchmarking options, our advisory desk is ready to review your constraints.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="cta-actions">
            <a href="/lets-talk" class="btn btn-accent btn-lg">Discuss your requirement</a>
            <a href="/partners" class="cta-link">
              <span>Review our partner ecosystem</span>
              <span class="link-arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .about-page-wrapper {
    background-color: #ffffff;
    padding: 72px 0 96px;
  }

  .about-container {
    max-width: 1120px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 24px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 80px;
  }

  /* Editorial Header */
  .about-header {
    max-width: 820px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    padding-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .about-kicker {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    color: var(--accent-blue);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .about-title {
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 4.5vw, 3.6rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.12;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .about-lead {
    font-size: 1.18rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    max-width: 65ch;
  }

  /* Narrative Section */
  .narrative-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 48px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .narrative-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr;
      gap: 64px;
    }
  }

  .narrative-main {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 18px;
  }

  .narrative-heading {
    font-size: 1.85rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .narrative-prose {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    max-width: 58ch;
  }

  .commercial-disclosure-box {
    background: #f8fafc;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-blue);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: 28px 32px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .disclosure-title {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .disclosure-text {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  /* Three Commercial Roles */
  .roles-section {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 36px;
  }

  .roles-header {
    max-width: 720px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .roles-title {
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .roles-subhead {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    max-width: 58ch;
  }

  .roles-flow {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  @media (min-width: 860px) {
    .roles-flow {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 24px;
    }
  }

  .role-card {
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 32px 28px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
    transition: border-color 160ms ease, transform 160ms ease;
  }

  .role-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent-blue);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .role-meta {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .role-index {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent-blue);
  }

  .role-type {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #64748b;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .role-title {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .role-desc {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .role-scope {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: #475569;
    padding-top: 14px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  /* Closing CTA Band */
  .about-cta-band {
    background: #0b1120;
    color: #ffffff;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 48px 40px;
  }

  .cta-inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 28px;
  }

  @media (min-width: 860px) {
    .cta-inner {
      flex-direction: row;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 40px;
    }
  }

  .cta-copy {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    max-width: 580px;
  }

  .cta-title {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.4rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .cta-desc {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #cbd5e1;
  }

  .cta-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
    align-items: flex-start;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .cta-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    color: #cbd5e1;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 160ms ease;
  }

  .cta-link:hover {
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .link-arrow {
    transition: transform 160ms ease;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .cta-link:hover .link-arrow {
    transform: translateX(3px);
  }
</style>
